sequenceDiagram
  actor C as Client
  participant KC as Keycloak
  participant G as API Gateway
  participant S as insight-service
  participant U as usage-service
  participant O as Ollama
  C->>KC: asks for a token (het-security-realm)
  KC-->>C: JWT
  C->>G: GET /api/v1/insight/saving-tips/1 + Bearer JWT
  G->>KC: public keys (JWKS)
  alt missing or invalid token
    G-->>C: 401 Unauthorized
  else valid token
    G->>S: insight-service route (circuit breaker)
    S->>U: GET /api/v1/usage/1?days=3
    U-->>S: devices and kWh used
    S->>O: prompt (Spring AI)
    O-->>S: tips
    S-->>G: {userId, tips, energyUsage}
    G-->>C: 200 OK
  end
  Note over G: service down: the circuit breaker returns the fallback route (503)
